even union square's shockingly

00:17:46.986 --> 00:17:48.986
high 22% vacancy rate.

00:17:49.822 --> 00:17:52.822
The 50% vacancy rates on venice

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:54.795
are a crisis.

00:17:54.795 --> 00:17:55.596
Since taking office I have

00:17:55.596 --> 00:17:57.431
heard from many building owners

00:17:57.431 --> 00:17:58.131
