00:18:18.152 --> 00:18:18.886
We should be helping fill these

00:18:18.886 --> 00:18:21.855
vacancies not standing in the

00:18:21.855 --> 00:18:22.589
way especially when this change

00:18:22.589 --> 00:18:23.323
is in line with the history of

00:18:23.323 --> 00:18:25.323
