00:18:29.163 --> 00:18:31.799
the street and despite a

00:18:31.799 --> 00:18:32.233
decline in tenants now in its

00:18:32.233 --> 00:18:33.000
third decade.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.236
>> our planning code currently

00:18:35.236 --> 00:18:35.902
requires protective form

00:18:35.902 --> 00:18:36.637
prospective formula retail

00:18:36.637 --> 00:18:39.370
stores to navigate multi-month

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:40.607
long conditional use processes.

00:18:40.607 --> 00:18:43.510
If we know these spaces are

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:43.877
hard to fill, why are we making

00:18:43.877 --> 00:18:45.877
it harder?

00:18:47.181 --> 00:18:47.982
We need to be doing all that we

00:18:47.982 --> 00:18:48.316
can to make it easier to open

00:18:48.316 --> 00:18:50.316
stores.

00:18:50.918 --> 00:18:51.586
We need to increase flexibility

00:18:51.586 --> 00:18:54.322
with van ness which this

00:18:54.322 --> 00:18:54.922
ordinance will do helping

00:18:54.922 --> 00:18:55.689
